						<code style="font-size:11px;">email()</code> handler. Attachments stored in R2, full MIME
						parsing.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="ix-feat-card">
					<div class="ix-feat-icon">
						<Icon name="lucide:list-ordered" />
					</div>
					<h3>Email sequences</h3>
					<p>
						Schedule multi-step drip campaigns per contact. Powered by Cloudflare Queues — cron-triggered
						every 5 minutes, never misses a step.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="ix-feat-card">
					<div class="ix-feat-icon">
						<Icon name="lucide:bell" />
					</div>
					<h3>Real-time notifications</h3>
					<p>
						New inbound emails trigger instant browser notifications via a persistent WebSocket connected to
						a Durable Object. No polling.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="ix-feat-card">
					<div class="ix-feat-icon">
						<Icon name="lucide:users" />
					</div>
					<h3>Multi-user with roles</h3>
					<p>
						Admin and member roles, invite-link onboarding. Secure session-based auth with login rate
						limiting via Workers KV.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="ix-feat-card">
					<div class="ix-feat-icon">
						<Icon name="lucide:key-round" />
					</div>
					<h3>Scoped API keys</h3>
					<p>
						Programmatic access for outbound replies and sequence management. Per-key domain scoping with
						Workers Rate Limiting (100 req/60s).
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

