							</li>
							<li>
								A <strong>domain</strong> on Cloudflare with Email Routing enabled.
							</li>
							<li>
								A <strong>Cloudflare API token</strong> with Email Routing (Edit), DNS (Edit), and Zone
								(Read) permissions. See the{" "}
								<a href="/cloudflare-token" style="color:var(--green);text-decoration:none;">
									CF Token guide →
								</a>
							</li>
							<li>
