							</li>
							<li>
								The <strong>emailflare repo</strong> cloned:{" "}
								<code>git clone https://github.com/0xdps/emailflare</code>
							</li>
						</ul>
						<div class="callout callout-green">
							<span class="callout-icon">ℹ️</span>
							<span>
								Inbox shares the same <code>emailflare</code> D1 database as the main worker. If you
								already have the main worker deployed, the inbox deploy script will detect and reuse the
								existing database.
							</span>
						</div>
