								<div class="qs-body">
									<strong>Install dependencies</strong> — from the repo root run{" "}
									<code>just install</code>. This installs all workspace dependencies for the
									dashboard app and marketing site.
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="qs-step">
								<div class="qs-num">2</div>
								<div class="qs-body">
									<strong>Configure local environment</strong> —{" "}
									<code>cp apps/dashboard/.dev.vars.example apps/dashboard/.dev.vars</code>. For
									production, set secrets via <code>just dashboard-secret &lt;KEY&gt;</code>.
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="qs-step">
								<div class="qs-num">3</div>
								<div class="qs-body">
									<strong>Generate VAPID keys</strong> — run{" "}
									<code>npx web-push generate-vapid-keys</code> and configure Web Push keys.
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="qs-step">
								<div class="qs-num">4</div>
								<div class="qs-body">
									<strong>Run the deploy script</strong> — <code>just dashboard-deploy</code>. The
									script applies D1 migrations remotely, builds the Next.js React Server Components,
