							Dashboard endpoints use a session cookie set on <code>POST /api/auth/login</code>.
							Programmatic endpoints accept a bearer token:
						</p>
						<pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cb-header">Authorization</span><span class="cb-plain">: Bearer </span><span class="cb-str">eflive_xxxxxxxxxxxx</span></code></pre>

